  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(a3 + b3 + c3 - 3abc) = 405, and (a + b + c) = 15\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n(a3 + b3 + c3 - 3abc) = 1/2 (a + b + c) [(a - b)2 + (b - c)2+(c - a)2]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(a3 + b3 + c3 - 3abc) = 1/2 (a + b + c) [(a - b)2 + (b - c)2+(c - a)2]\n\n⇒ 405 = 1/2 × 15 (a - b)2 + (b - c)2+(c - a)2. \n\n⇒ (a - b)2 + (b - c)2+(c - a)2. = 810 / 15\n\n⇒ (a - b)2 + (b - c)2+(c - a)2 = 54\n\n**∴ The correct option is 2**",
